---
// Astroplate pack (#1653): news/updates teaser — reframed from the original's authored
// blog cards as a lightweight pointer at the blog collection. Static placeholder items
// rather than a live query, matching the AstroWind pack's own placeholder-section pattern;
// the owner replaces these with real posts (or deletes the section) in the app.
---

<section class="ap-news" aria-labelledby="news-heading">
  <div class="ap-news-head">
    <h2 id="news-heading">Latest news</h2>
    <a class="ap-news-link" href="/blog/">All updates →</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="ap-news-grid">
    <li>
      <span class="ap-news-tag">Announcement</span>
      <h3>Share your latest milestone</h3>
      <p>Replace this with a recap of a recent event, campaign, or achievement.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="ap-news-tag">Get involved</span>
      <h3>Introduce an upcoming opportunity</h3>
      <p>Tell visitors about a way to volunteer, donate, or attend.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="ap-news-tag">Update</span>
      <h3>Post a note from the team</h3>
      <p>Keep supporters in the loop between bigger announcements.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>
